{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "満開っ!🌸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "6期生の長嶋凛桜(ながしまりお)です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "❀ 𓂃𓈒𓏸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "昨夜は地震の発生がありました\n皆さん、ご無事でしょうか?"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "被害に遭われた方々が1日でも早く普段の暮らしに戻れるよう願っています"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私のブログが少しでも誰かに元気を届けられますようにꕤ.·*."}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "❀ 𓂃𓈒𓏸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日も読みに来てくれてありがとう☺︎\nという訳で、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mobEP7V7i.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あれ?\nなんか日本っぽくないぞ?\nと思ったそこの貴方!"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぴーんぽーん!"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ということで"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私は今、どこにいるでしょうか?"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こっこでーす!\nここ!ここ!\nここにいましたー!"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "某番組でよく聞くこの台詞\n言ってみたかったんですよね\n(何の番組でしょうかっ?)"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "おっと\n質問を投げすぎた🤦🏻‍♀️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そんなことはておき、\nいや、どこやねん！ということで"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "台北に行ってまいりました!"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mobQYnHVS.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お花2"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "このお花、本物なんですよっ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mob7z3wwK.png", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ひーつんと魯肉飯!\nなまら美味しかった"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんな感じで思い出盛りだくさん!\nそんな私たち6期生の様子を観られるのが"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "｢乃木坂46 6期生稼働中｣です!"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "第9回がLeminoにて配信中となっております！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今回からは台北を舞台に、グループのPRやロケ最終日に行う路上ライブに挑戦してきました!"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "初の海外ロケということで終始ワクワクが止まらない2泊3日の旅でしたෆ˚*\n(ハプニングもあったり?!)"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆さん、要チェックですよ〜👀"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ちょこっと裏話"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mobpHs9Qf.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "臭豆腐を食べたのさ😎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "意外と量が多くてね､､､\n6期の皆に一緒に食べない？ｹﾛｯ\nって誘ったんだけど"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "全員漏れなく逃げていきました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ｴｯ?ﾅﾝﾃﾞ\nｵｲｼｲﾉﾆ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "どうやら台北の食が私の舌にマッチするようです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "また行きたいな"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日はこの辺で"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "また書くね☺︎"}], "source": "official"}